member.remarks:
Typical usage when emitting a fact:

var causation = Causation.Create(correlationId, traceId, actorId);
var fact = Fact.Create("OrderPlaced", payload, causation);

remarks.para:
This type is typically returned from aggregate state transition methods:

var result = TransitionResult<OrderState>.Success(newState, facts);
if (Result.IsSuccess) { /* persist newState and facts */ }
